eG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17963, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YU7Bw3zHdeVPgCmdh3v2bm", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy. The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy in production and should not be redeployed until it is fixed. The orchestrator partial failure should be investigated."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48563, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YU7Bw3zHdeVPgCmdh3v2bm", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48563, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YU7Bw3zHdeVPgCmdh3v2bm", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49518, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Sz1sSV67qdsWnPgNijoMfo", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49818, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Sz1sSV67qdsWnPgNijoMfo", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms"